# NS-WIRE-B2: every file under this directory is referenced by a 64-hex SHA-256 pin in
# doc/tasks/NS-WIRE-B2.md (Canonical Evidence). They are stored byte-exactly (-text): Git must never
# rewrite line endings, otherwise a fresh checkout under core.autocrlf=true would change the bytes and
# break every pin. Same intent as the "-text" pins in the root .gitattributes (GOV-EOL-PIN-1 family);
# -text is used here because the evidence mixes JSON emitted by Utf8JsonWriter (LF) with logs emitted
# by PowerShell/.NET test hosts (CRLF) and both must round-trip unchanged.
* -text
** -text
